WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.567 --> 00:00:03.003
Major shakeup today at three media giant

00:00:03.003 --> 00:00:05.238
NBC's Universal CEO has stepped down.

00:00:05.271 --> 00:00:06.473
Tucker Carlson,

00:00:06.473 --> 00:00:07.073
a popular

00:00:07.073 --> 00:00:07.907
right wing media

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.476
host, is out at Fox News

00:00:09.476 --> 00:00:10.810
and CNN anchor

00:00:10.810 --> 00:00:13.213
Don Lemon is out after 17 years.

00:00:13.480 --> 00:00:15.348
CNN's Oliver Darcy joins us now.

00:00:15.348 --> 00:00:17.183
Oliver, let's start with FOX.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.284
Do we know why

00:00:18.284 --> 00:00:19.686
they decided to take Carlson

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:22.355
off the network's highly rated show?

00:00:22.355 --> 00:00:24.290
A shocking development over at FOX.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:26.192
Tucker Carlson was the highest rated

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:28.661
single host over at that network he's

00:00:29.129 --> 00:00:30.397
been hosting the 8 p.m.

00:00:30.397 --> 00:00:31.731
show for several years.

00:00:31.731 --> 00:00:33.800
And a sudden announcement today from Fox.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:34.768
I read you part of it.

00:00:34.768 --> 00:00:35.835
Announcing his departure,

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:36.603
it was very short.

00:00:36.603 --> 00:00:37.370
It just says

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.171
Fox News

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:39.172
Media and Tucker

00:00:39.172 --> 00:00:41.141
Carlson have agreed to part ways.

00:00:41.141 --> 00:00:42.342
We thank him for his service

00:00:42.342 --> 00:00:44.344
to the network as a host and prior

00:00:44.344 --> 00:00:45.545
to that as a contributor.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.513
And it goes on to say

00:00:46.513 --> 00:00:47.147
that Carlson's

00:00:47.147 --> 00:00:48.681
last program already air

00:00:48.681 --> 00:00:50.283
to air on Friday.

00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:51.885
Even though Carlson on Friday

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:52.819
said that he looked forward

00:00:52.819 --> 00:00:54.587
to greeting viewers back on Monday.

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:55.388
Now, of course,

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.557
we should point out that Tucker Carlson

00:00:57.557 --> 00:00:59.492
was one of the most extreme hosts

00:00:59.492 --> 00:01:00.493
over on that channel,

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.362
and he's sowed a lot of distrust

00:01:02.362 --> 00:01:04.364
in the legitimacy of the 2020 election.

00:01:04.531 --> 00:01:05.065
And, of course,

00:01:05.065 --> 00:01:06.766
this announcement is coming

00:01:06.766 --> 00:01:09.069
just days after Fox News

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:10.336
settled that Dominion

00:01:10.336 --> 00:01:11.304
voting systems

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:14.507
lawsuit for a staggering amount of money,

00:01:14.507 --> 00:01:16.509
the highest ever

00:01:16.509 --> 00:01:18.078
defamation settlement

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.312
in the history of U.S.

00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:20.213
media. That's known.

00:01:20.213 --> 00:01:21.214
And so it's hard

00:01:21.214 --> 00:01:23.316
to disconnect those two events.

00:01:23.316 --> 00:01:24.918
But the network and Carlson

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:27.153
are not connecting them themselves.

00:01:27.153 --> 00:01:28.088
And I should also note

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:28.688
that we reached out

00:01:28.688 --> 00:01:30.390
to Carlson several times today,

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:32.492
and he has not not responded

00:01:32.492 --> 00:01:34.060
to comment requests.

00:01:34.060 --> 00:01:34.794
While there was also

00:01:34.794 --> 00:01:35.695
a big development today

00:01:35.695 --> 00:01:36.596
at our own network,

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.732
CNN Parting Ways with anchor Don Lemon,

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:42.735
another stunning announcement.

00:01:42.735 --> 00:01:43.937
This comes earlier today.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.505
This came actually

00:01:45.505 --> 00:01:48.274
in an email to CNN staffers from CEO

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:49.676
Chris left over at CNN.

00:01:49.676 --> 00:01:51.711
I'll read you what he said in his email.

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:54.814
He said, CNN and Don have parted ways.

00:01:54.881 --> 00:01:55.915
Don will forever

00:01:55.915 --> 00:01:57.951
be a part of the CNN family

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.018
and we thank him

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:00.720
for his contributions over the past

00:02:00.720 --> 00:02:01.921
17 years.

00:02:01.921 --> 00:02:03.723
And it goes on.

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:05.592
But Don Lemon came out

00:02:05.592 --> 00:02:06.759
and he was more explicit.

00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.795
He said that the network had fired him

00:02:08.795 --> 00:02:09.662
and then he

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.564
really lashed out and said that

00:02:13.066 --> 00:02:14.100
he was hoping that

00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:15.034
someone in management

00:02:15.034 --> 00:02:15.935
would have had the decency

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:18.571
to tell him directly about this

00:02:18.571 --> 00:02:20.073
about this firing.

00:02:20.073 --> 00:02:22.909
And CNN PR then put out a statement

00:02:23.176 --> 00:02:24.310
separately saying that

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.246
what Don Lemon had said

00:02:26.246 --> 00:02:27.213
was not accurate

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.982
and that Don Lemon did have

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:30.650
the opportunity to meet with management.

00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:31.651
So there's a back and forth

00:02:31.651 --> 00:02:32.552
playing out

00:02:32.552 --> 00:02:34.888
over there at CNN in public as well.

00:02:35.488 --> 00:02:35.855
All right.

00:02:35.855 --> 00:02:37.857
Let's talk about NBC Universal.

00:02:37.857 --> 00:02:39.959
Big news out of there, too.

00:02:39.959 --> 00:02:41.928
Big news over at NBCU

00:02:41.928 --> 00:02:43.129
where the head of that

00:02:43.129 --> 00:02:44.497
company has stepped down

00:02:44.497 --> 00:02:47.867
amid a sexual harassment allegation.

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.202
It's coming from

00:02:49.202 --> 00:02:52.639
CNBC anchor or correspondent

00:02:52.639 --> 00:02:53.573
Hadley Gamble.

00:02:53.573 --> 00:02:55.542
Her lawyer has put out a statement

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:58.144
saying that after they filed

00:02:58.144 --> 00:03:01.181
filed a complaint,

00:03:01.181 --> 00:03:02.549
this led to an investigation,

00:03:02.549 --> 00:03:04.517
a third party investigation, NBCU,

00:03:04.517 --> 00:03:06.519
and this ultimately led to Comcast

00:03:06.519 --> 00:03:08.655
Nbcu's parent company

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:10.323
deciding to remove Shell.

00:03:10.323 --> 00:03:11.391
And Shell acknowledged

00:03:11.391 --> 00:03:12.392
the inappropriate relationship

00:03:12.392 --> 00:03:14.227
in a statement of its own on Sunday.

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:15.728
So shockwaves

00:03:15.728 --> 00:03:16.996
rolling through the media industry

00:03:16.996 --> 00:03:17.597
today, Pam.

00:03:17.597 --> 00:03:18.731
Yeah, big day for you

00:03:18.731 --> 00:03:19.832
covering all these developments.

00:03:19.832 --> 00:03:20.967
Oliver Darcy, thank you.

